hings which the Gentiles sacrifice, they sacrifice to demons, and not to God, and I don’t desire that you would have fellowship with demons.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Timothy 4:1","note":"But the Spirit says expressly that in later times some will fall away from the faith, paying attention to seducing spirits and doctrines of demons,","source":"web"},{"ref":"James 2:19","note":"You believe that God is one. You do well. The demons also believe, and shudder.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}